# The DEUS Worker: feature map

This project is the Cloudflare Worker that hosts DEUS codebases, written in DEUS and compiled to JavaScript by the
js target (task 41714c0d). It answers `deus push` and `deus pull`, keeps each branch head safe under concurrent
pushes, checks API keys, and serves this explorer. Every request handler of the replication API is DEUS; the
JavaScript around it in `platform/worker/` wires the platform, keeps the pack lookups' caches and draws the explorer's
pages. It mounts the toolchain, `@dxos/base` and `@dxos/web`, whose `Js` library reaches JavaScript.

## Extensions

| Term | URI |
| --- | --- |
| `feature` | `org.dxos.deus.feature@1.0` |

## Replication

What `deus push` and `deus pull` talk to, under `/v1/@owner/project`: bundles, packs, files beside them, and the
branch heads a push moves.

```mdl
feature W-1: Replication API
  status: shipped
  tags: home
  defs: Worker.Bundles.serve | Worker.PackFiles.serve | Worker.Files.serve | Worker.Objects.serve | Worker.Names.serve
```

```mdl
feature W-2: Branch heads move by compare-and-swap, and every move is logged
  status: shipped
  parent: W-1
  defs: Worker.Heads.moveHead | Worker.Heads.verdict | Worker.Heads.serveLog
```

```mdl
feature W-3: Pack indexes answer a lookup with a binary search
  status: shipped
  parent: W-1
  defs: Worker.Packs.search | Worker.Packs.checkIndex | Worker.Packs.checkCombined
```

## Access

Who may write: API keys, their scopes and projects, and the admin API that mints and revokes them.

```mdl
feature W-4: API keys
  status: shipped
  tags: home
  defs: Worker.Keys.judge | Worker.Keys.parseKey | Worker.KeyAdmin.serve | Worker.KeyAdmin.mint
```

## Platform

Typed bindings for what a Worker reaches: the R2 bucket, the D1 database, HTTP, Web Crypto, and the routes a request
can take.

```mdl
feature W-5: Platform bindings
  status: shipped
  tags: home
  defs: Worker.R2.listAll | Worker.D1.first | Worker.Http.response | Worker.Crypto.sha256 | Worker.Routes.route | Worker.Paths.isSegment
```
